<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  English is the package's default language (see DefaultLanguage in YTMusicWP.csproj): this is the text a phone in a
  language the app is not translated into shows. It also has to carry every key the translated files carry, or the
  build warns that a resource has no neutral value (MakePRI 0xdef01051) and a phone in another language may fail to
  read it.

  The strings read from code (Services/Loc.cs) are the same text the call sites pass as the English fallback; the
  x:Uid ones are the text the markup already carries. LocalizationResourcesTests keeps this file in step with both.
-->
